/E (Digital platforms can support learning, improve parent communication, showcase teaching practice and expand access to educational resources. The policy problem arises when visibility is treated as automatically beneficial without clear rules on consent, purpose, storage, sharing, removal and accountability.)
/Pg 13 0 R
