137 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 76 0 R
/E (This brief asks whether education systems are prepared to manage classroom-content risks while preserving the legitimate benefits of educational technology. The research combined review of national education policies, regional digital-rights legislation and institutional guidance with field observations, semi-structured interviews with educators and parents, and stakeholder dialogue through a virtual webinar.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
