/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (The central policy challenge is to make consent specific, informed, revocable and safe to refuse. Schools need centralized registries, clear purpose limitations, defined retention periods, and accessible complaint or takedown pathways so that parents and learners can exercise their rights without fearing retaliation or reputational consequences.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [18]
>>
