/P 81 0 R
/E (The Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications and the National Communication Council have partnered with platforms such as TikTok on online safety,22 yet clear rules specific to classroom content remain absent. The result is a regulatory vacuum precisely where harm to minors is most likely: schools lack sector-specific guidance, parents lack meaningful consent mechanisms, and educators lack professional standards for digital conduct.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [12 14 13]
>>
